 ## Critical: WASM loading (especially Vite)
-Default loader fetches **`/pkg/rppg_wasm.js`** and **`.wasm`**. If the backend never loads, **`backendMode` is `"unavailable"`**, **`metrics.bpm` stays null**, and **no error may be thrown** — same symptom as warmup.
